WEBVTT

00:00:05.110 --> 00:00:07.850
I knew I shouldn't cry, but...

00:00:05.400 --> 00:00:09.320
<b>How to Replenish Water</b>

00:00:07.850 --> 00:00:10.370
I just felt so lost...

00:00:10.370 --> 00:00:11.820
But, I'm glad.

00:00:12.230 --> 00:00:14.240
I'm so thirsty.

00:00:17.010 --> 00:00:19.830
Oh. I didn't bring water with me.

00:00:20.990 --> 00:00:22.040
What?

00:00:22.040 --> 00:00:24.460
You're lying, right? You brought some?

00:00:22.040 --> 00:00:25.220
I'm sorry. I was in a hurry.

00:00:26.010 --> 00:00:27.810
It can't be true...

00:00:27.810 --> 00:00:30.000
I can't go on...

00:00:30.390 --> 00:00:31.810
<i>That was careless.</i>

00:00:31.810 --> 00:00:35.590
<i>At this rate, both of us will start suffering
from dehydration on the way back.</i>

00:00:35.590 --> 00:00:38.870
Shion. Was there anything here on this island?

00:00:38.870 --> 00:00:40.010
Anything?

00:00:40.010 --> 00:00:42.060
Oh. Now that you ask...

00:00:53.440 --> 00:00:53.730
<b>Are You Lost?</b>

00:00:53.730 --> 00:00:56.530
<b>Are You Lost?</b>

00:01:50.870 --> 00:01:54.060
Is this it? The cave you walked into?

00:01:54.060 --> 00:01:54.800
Yes.

00:01:54.800 --> 00:01:58.490
Where I walked, it was all
squishy and it smelled rotten...

00:01:58.490 --> 00:01:59.290
Hey!

00:02:00.320 --> 00:02:01.430
Wh-What's that?

00:02:01.870 --> 00:02:03.230
Bats.

00:02:03.230 --> 00:02:05.830
I've seen them leaving the island.

00:02:05.830 --> 00:02:07.670
This must be where they nest.

00:02:09.140 --> 00:02:13.370
<i>Which must mean that there isn't
anything for the bats to eat here.</i>

00:02:13.740 --> 00:02:14.530
<i>Still...</i>

00:02:16.890 --> 00:02:17.790
Found some.

00:02:23.760 --> 00:02:26.070
It seems some rainwater collected here.

00:02:26.070 --> 00:02:26.890
It's fresh water.

00:02:26.890 --> 00:02:27.860
Oh, good!

00:02:27.860 --> 00:02:29.000
But...

00:02:29.370 --> 00:02:30.910
Try smelling it.

00:02:33.670 --> 00:02:35.240
It... smells like a drain?

00:02:35.240 --> 00:02:37.490
It's been contaminated by bat droppings.

00:02:37.800 --> 00:02:41.090
If we drank it, we'd likely
get some kind of infection.

00:02:41.390 --> 00:02:45.010
Then... we can't use it as moisture, right?

00:02:46.050 --> 00:02:47.480
I'm sorry.

00:02:47.930 --> 00:02:52.760
It's all my fault, and I'm dragging
you down with me.

00:02:55.560 --> 00:02:56.820
No.

00:02:56.820 --> 00:02:58.360
Shion, this is a great find.

00:02:58.890 --> 00:03:01.000
True, it's terrible as water,

00:03:01.000 --> 00:03:02.820
but with this, things will work out.

00:03:03.180 --> 00:03:04.180
Huh?

00:03:04.180 --> 00:03:05.950
There's no point in staying here.

00:03:05.950 --> 00:03:09.830
Now, I'm sure it's tough on you,
but we need to get ready to go back.

00:03:09.830 --> 00:03:13.210
First, we'll gather things that have
drifted ashore and rebuild the raft.

00:03:18.160 --> 00:03:20.060
O-Okay.

00:03:28.260 --> 00:03:29.410
That should do it.

00:03:29.410 --> 00:03:30.580
Homare-san.

00:03:31.260 --> 00:03:32.650
What are we doing with this?

00:03:33.180 --> 00:03:35.060
We'll attach them to the back of the raft.

00:03:35.060 --> 00:03:44.870
<b>Bat Island</b>

00:03:35.060 --> 00:03:44.870
<b>Ahomushi Idiot's Island</b>

00:03:35.480 --> 00:03:39.040
Since you were carried here on a current,

00:03:39.040 --> 00:03:41.310
when we go back, it'll be the reverse.

00:03:41.310 --> 00:03:44.870
We need to travel so that
the bottles trail straight behind us.

00:03:46.700 --> 00:03:51.420
It might not be very reliable, but we
should do everything we can think of.

00:03:52.120 --> 00:03:54.210
We're going back to the island, Shion.

00:03:54.480 --> 00:03:55.380
Yes.

00:03:55.380 --> 00:03:56.620
We are!

00:04:00.410 --> 00:04:02.470
Which is easy to say, but...

00:04:08.630 --> 00:04:10.650
My head aches...

00:04:10.650 --> 00:04:12.500
I'm getting lightheaded.

00:04:12.500 --> 00:04:15.390
Water... I want water...

00:04:15.390 --> 00:04:16.910
Yes.

00:04:17.330 --> 00:04:20.940
My dehydration symptoms are worsening, too.

00:04:21.260 --> 00:04:23.610
Say, Homare-san.

00:04:24.090 --> 00:04:27.780
This water from the cave...
What are we using it for?

00:04:28.140 --> 00:04:31.850
I thought I'd try testing UV sterilization, but...

00:04:31.850 --> 00:04:33.120
Sterilization?

00:04:33.120 --> 00:04:34.710
You can do that?

00:04:35.010 --> 00:04:37.380
It doesn't seem like it will work that easily...

00:04:41.020 --> 00:04:44.170
Just suppose, even if it doesn't work...

00:04:44.460 --> 00:04:47.390
even... just as it is...

00:04:51.120 --> 00:04:52.140
Shion.

00:04:52.610 --> 00:04:55.060
Do you know what will
happen if we drink this water?

00:04:55.060 --> 00:04:57.480
Huh? No, I don't.

00:04:57.480 --> 00:05:02.050
To be blunt, within 30 minutes,
diarrhea and vomiting would begin.

00:05:02.050 --> 00:05:04.900
We would lose more moisture than we gained.

00:05:05.330 --> 00:05:08.090
In moments, we would both be incapacitated

00:05:08.090 --> 00:05:10.160
and we wouldn't be able
to make it back to the island.

00:05:12.620 --> 00:05:16.850
Still, we do need immediate hydration.

00:05:16.850 --> 00:05:19.460
But we can't drink that water, right?

00:05:19.460 --> 00:05:20.530
Right.

00:05:20.990 --> 00:05:22.340
So what do we do?

00:05:22.640 --> 00:05:24.020
What will we do?

00:05:24.870 --> 00:05:28.390
The thing is, the colon can absorb water.

00:05:28.390 --> 00:05:29.510
Huh?

00:05:29.780 --> 00:05:30.770
Which means...

00:05:32.560 --> 00:05:34.520
We will drink this through our anuses!

00:05:34.520 --> 00:05:36.940
As it will not pass through our
stomachs, it should be fairly safe!

00:05:38.760 --> 00:05:40.110
Anus?

00:05:43.280 --> 00:05:46.400
Turn your bottom this way and
pull down your underwear, Shion.

00:05:46.400 --> 00:05:49.180
No! I don't want to!

00:05:49.180 --> 00:05:50.950
You don't want to die, do you?

00:05:50.950 --> 00:05:54.240
O-Of course not! I don't want to die.

00:05:54.240 --> 00:05:56.860
But... I-I-I just can't!

00:05:56.860 --> 00:05:58.520
That's where stuff comes out...

00:05:58.520 --> 00:06:00.070
How could you possibly...

00:06:00.070 --> 00:06:01.470
It won't go in!

00:06:01.470 --> 00:06:02.380
It will.

00:06:02.380 --> 00:06:05.710
Don't worry. I'll transfer it with my mouth.

00:06:05.710 --> 00:06:07.940
Just relax and look at the clouds.

00:06:26.780 --> 00:06:30.700
<b><i>Have I lost something?</i></b>

00:06:26.970 --> 00:06:30.200
Have I lost something?

00:06:30.590 --> 00:06:32.550
No, I have not.

00:06:30.700 --> 00:06:32.410
<b><i>Have I lost something?
No, I have not.</i></b>

00:06:32.410 --> 00:06:34.870
<b><i>Have I lost something?
No, I have not.
I have simply ensured my survival.</i></b>

00:06:32.550 --> 00:06:35.000
I have simply ensured my survival.

00:06:34.870 --> 00:06:35.950
<b><i>Have I lost something?
No, I have not.
I have simply ensured my survival.
Yes.</i></b>

00:06:35.000 --> 00:06:37.820
Yes. I'm sure it's true.

00:06:35.950 --> 00:06:37.830
<b><i>Have I lost something?
No, I have not.
I have simply ensured my survival.
Yes.
 I'm sure it's true.</i></b>

00:06:37.820 --> 00:06:38.830
After all...

00:06:37.830 --> 00:06:38.830
<b><i>Have I lost something?
No, I have not.
I have simply ensured my survival.
Yes. 
I'm sure it's true.
After all...</i></b>

00:06:38.830 --> 00:06:39.590
Shion.

00:06:39.590 --> 00:06:43.670
I know you're still suffering,
but I need you to do one more thing.

00:06:43.660 --> 00:06:46.120
I had no choice. It doesn't count.

00:06:44.430 --> 00:06:47.300
Give me about ten mouthfuls.

00:06:46.120 --> 00:06:47.300
I did it to survive...

00:06:47.300 --> 00:06:50.290
That should be about 200 ml.

00:06:50.290 --> 00:06:51.930
I'm getting close to my limit, too.

00:06:51.930 --> 00:06:52.790
Huh?

00:06:55.970 --> 00:06:58.150
Now, Shion. Hurry.

00:06:58.150 --> 00:07:00.230
You'll have to dig your tongue in.

00:07:00.230 --> 00:07:01.100
No...

00:07:01.100 --> 00:07:01.940
Come on.

00:07:01.940 --> 00:07:04.360
Don't make me do this!

00:07:04.650 --> 00:07:06.900
It's for our survival, Shion!

00:07:14.020 --> 00:07:16.460
Say, Homare-san...

00:07:16.460 --> 00:07:22.050
What happened today... let's make sure
to keep it a secret between the two of us.

00:07:22.050 --> 00:07:23.040
Hey! Shion!

00:07:23.380 --> 00:07:25.560
Why are you shouting? What happened?

00:07:26.640 --> 00:07:27.790
That's...

00:07:33.180 --> 00:07:36.180
<b>Are You Lost?</b>

00:07:33.180 --> 00:07:36.180
Really?

00:07:42.260 --> 00:07:44.270
Mutsu. Look.

00:08:02.370 --> 00:08:04.290
Hey!

00:08:04.290 --> 00:08:05.800
Homare-san!

00:08:05.800 --> 00:08:06.710
Yes.

00:08:07.260 --> 00:08:08.380
It's Asuka and Mutsu!

00:08:13.060 --> 00:08:15.750
Shion, you worked hard to get this far.

00:08:15.750 --> 00:08:17.430
We're almost to shore.

00:08:17.430 --> 00:08:18.310
Shion?

00:08:20.250 --> 00:08:21.180
Shion?

00:08:23.160 --> 00:08:27.480
Everyone!

00:08:28.400 --> 00:08:29.780
Shion-san!

00:08:29.780 --> 00:08:31.650
Welcome back, Shion.

00:08:33.060 --> 00:08:34.420
I'm back.

00:08:34.910 --> 00:08:36.380
Welcome back!

00:08:36.380 --> 00:08:38.360
I'm so glad!

00:08:39.450 --> 00:08:42.000
We made it back... I'm so happy!

00:08:42.660 --> 00:08:44.580
Kindness can cost you your life.

00:08:44.580 --> 00:08:47.460
Think about your own survival first.

00:08:49.040 --> 00:08:52.510
<i>Papa, I'm sorry I didn't do as you taught me.</i>

00:08:52.510 --> 00:08:53.370
<i>But...</i>

00:08:54.050 --> 00:08:56.190
Don't make us worry like that!

00:08:56.190 --> 00:08:57.530
I'm sorry.

00:08:57.530 --> 00:08:59.430
I'm just so glad you're safe!

00:09:01.810 --> 00:09:03.930
Homare!

00:09:01.810 --> 00:09:03.930
Homare-san!

00:09:03.930 --> 00:09:05.740
Yes, I'm coming.

00:09:12.440 --> 00:09:14.530
What d'you think? A feast, right?

00:09:14.530 --> 00:09:16.780
Mutsu and I made it together!

00:09:16.780 --> 00:09:20.980
We couldn't manage sole meunière,
but we tried sauteing it.

00:09:20.980 --> 00:09:22.040
It's quite luxurious.

00:09:22.040 --> 00:09:22.840
Yes, it is!

00:09:22.840 --> 00:09:24.410
Let's hurry up and eat!

00:09:24.740 --> 00:09:26.540
Thank you for the food!

00:09:29.320 --> 00:09:30.960
It's really delicious!

00:09:30.960 --> 00:09:33.300
Eat lots, Shion!

00:09:33.300 --> 00:09:35.090
Yes. And you, too, Homare-san.

00:09:35.450 --> 00:09:37.380
I will. Thanks.

00:09:39.790 --> 00:09:43.190
Oh, right. Homare.
You forgot to take water with you.

00:09:43.190 --> 00:09:45.020
How did you manage?

00:09:45.020 --> 00:09:46.540
Oh. Well, we just—

00:09:46.540 --> 00:09:48.250
It was all determination! Spirit!

00:09:48.250 --> 00:09:50.400
You can do anything with spirit!

00:09:56.570 --> 00:09:59.150
Say, Homare. What'll we do tomorrow?

00:09:59.150 --> 00:10:00.420
Yes, let's see...

00:10:00.420 --> 00:10:03.040
Isn't it about time to look
over the traps again?

00:10:03.040 --> 00:10:04.750
Yes, let's...

00:10:04.750 --> 00:10:07.840
Let's go look for something sweet again.

00:10:07.840 --> 00:10:09.770
Yes...

00:10:12.760 --> 00:10:14.670
Huh? Did she fall asleep?

00:10:14.670 --> 00:10:16.340
She worked hard today.

00:10:22.160 --> 00:10:23.730
Good night.

00:10:30.060 --> 00:10:33.310
Today we'll be setting a trap for wild boar,

00:10:33.670 --> 00:10:35.650
but before that, spread this on your hands.

00:10:35.990 --> 00:10:37.610
What is it?

00:10:37.940 --> 00:10:39.320
Boar droppings.

00:10:39.320 --> 00:10:41.490
No!

00:10:41.490 --> 00:10:44.240
W-We seriously have to use that?

00:10:44.240 --> 00:10:46.800
Couldn't we use dirt instead?

00:10:46.800 --> 00:10:48.730
Boars have a keen sense of smell.

00:10:48.730 --> 00:10:52.830
If they smell humans,
they won't come near the trap.

00:10:52.830 --> 00:10:54.920
Stop complaining and do it.

00:10:54.920 --> 00:10:57.270
W-Well, then...

00:10:57.800 --> 00:11:02.600
I can't. I can't. I can't. I can't. I can't.

00:10:59.420 --> 00:11:02.600
It's all squelchy! It squishes!

00:11:02.600 --> 00:11:05.140
I can't. I can't. I can't. I can't. I can't.

00:11:03.270 --> 00:11:05.140
It stinks!

00:11:05.670 --> 00:11:06.790
It's your turn, Shion!

00:11:06.790 --> 00:11:10.050
Homare-san, please don't make her do it.

00:11:10.060 --> 00:11:13.060
<b>Poop Hand Cream</b>

00:11:10.060 --> 00:11:13.060
It's a little stinky!

00:11:10.060 --> 00:11:13.060
<b>All-Natural Ingredients</b>

00:11:10.060 --> 00:11:13.060
It erases the
scent of human
 from your traps!

00:11:10.060 --> 00:11:13.060
<b>Are You Lost?</b>

00:11:10.380 --> 00:11:13.060
Is that so?

00:11:14.860 --> 00:11:16.870
There. That should do it.

00:11:17.410 --> 00:11:20.110
Our bait-release snare trap is complete.

00:11:20.440 --> 00:11:23.280
Wow! It's all complicated and cool!

00:11:23.280 --> 00:11:25.830
There's food attached this time.

00:11:25.830 --> 00:11:28.370
Say, how is this trap tripped?

00:11:28.820 --> 00:11:31.160
Sensei, can we impose on you?

00:11:31.160 --> 00:11:33.380
I see. My time to shine, is it?

00:11:33.680 --> 00:11:36.350
Wait. It should be Shion this time.

00:11:36.350 --> 00:11:39.030
She hasn't used the poop hand
cream or helped to build the trap.

00:11:39.030 --> 00:11:41.030
You can do your part now.

00:11:41.030 --> 00:11:42.300
Wh-What do I do?

00:11:42.300 --> 00:11:45.370
Just step there where the lily bulb bait is.

00:11:45.370 --> 00:11:47.930
I don't want to. It's sort of scary...

00:11:47.930 --> 00:11:52.270
Now, Miss, don't you think
you're being a little selfish?

00:11:52.270 --> 00:11:53.370
No!

00:11:53.370 --> 00:11:56.530
I get it! Please don't touch
me with those hands.

00:11:58.550 --> 00:11:59.530
Say...

00:11:59.530 --> 00:12:02.700
Wh-Why are you all lined up over there?

00:12:02.700 --> 00:12:04.700
Doesn't matter. Just hurry up and do it.

00:12:12.400 --> 00:12:13.840
It has her name on it...

00:12:27.320 --> 00:12:29.500
<i>I'm coming, Homare.</i>
